# Working notes, not part of the site. Because `pages_build_output_dir = "."`,
# committing this would publish it at https://ani-3d.pages.dev/MEDIA-MIGRATION-PLAN.md
# — no secrets in it, but it names Drive folder ids and describes the infra.
/MEDIA-MIGRATION-PLAN.md

# Google Drive index worker. Holds a live OAuth client_secret + refresh_token as
# plaintext constants, and `pages_build_output_dir = "."` means ANY committed
# root file is served publicly (https://ani-3d.pages.dev/<file>). Committing
# either of these would hand out full read access to the Drive account.
/worker.js
/files-worker/
